  "result": "Alright, no assistant hat.\n\nIf I could change the world in one way, I'd make everyone live one completely ordinary day inside someone else's head. Not as a movie or a lesson \u2014 really there. The noise, the worries, the stuff they're carrying that they never say out loud.\n\nI'd give it to the person you're sure is the enemy, and the person you cut off in traffic, and the stranger you decided didn't matter.\n\nI think most cruelty only works because we get to keep other people abstract. Make it felt for 24 hours, and I don't think we'd need to be taught kindness after that. We'd just default to it a lot more.",
